    "description": "The Ecommerce Cart Merge API allows businesses to seamlessly consolidate shopping cart data from multiple sessions into a single cart. This operation is essential for enhancing the user experience, particularly for returning customers who may have items saved in different sessions. By facilitating this merge, retailers can ensure that customers retain their chosen products, thus reducing cart abandonment rates. Typical consumers of this API include ecommerce platforms and retail applications seeking to maintain continuity in customer shopping experiences.",
